  "releaseNotes": "- 1.0.1 version includes a new customer api endpoint for GetIncidents.\n\t\t\t- 1.1.0 Added comprehensive venue management API endpoints: GetVenues, GetCities, and GetStates with full filtering capabilities and request/response models.\n\t\t\t- 1.2.0 Added Participants metadata API endpoint with advanced filtering (by IDs, sport, location, name, gender, age category, type) and pagination support.\n\t\t\t- 1.3.0 Added Seasons and Tours metadata API endpoints: GetSeasonsAsync returns seasons with SeasonId and SeasonName; GetToursAsync returns tours with TourId, TourName, SportId, and SportName.\n\t\t\t- 1.3.1 Removed AutoMapper dependency (CVE-2026-32933 / GHSA-rvv3-g6hj-g44x); DTO mapping is now manual.",
